TODDO — Task-Oriented Dialogue Discourse cOherence

DATA + DERIVED DATA ARTIFACTS
=============================
Derived from the Schema-Guided Dialogue (SGD) dataset (Google Research), released
under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(CC BY-SA 4.0). All dataset artifacts here (perturbed utterances, annotations,
derived records) are distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

  License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
  Attribution: Rastogi et al. (2020), "Towards Scalable Multi-domain Conversational
  Agents: The Schema-Guided Dialogue Dataset," AAAI 2020.

TODDO intentionally modifies SGD turns; changes ARE made and are recorded
per-record in the `passes` provenance. Derived data is shared under the same
license (ShareAlike).

